{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>屯門海華路11號一個回收場發生火警。今日（13日）下午1時27分，警方接報回收場冒煙，據報有廢鐵着火。消防派出一喉一煙帽隊灌救，救護車在場戒備，暫時未有受傷報告。網上圖片可見，現場冒出濃煙直沖上半空，遠處亦可看見。</p><p>下午2時許，記者到場視察，仍見到消防員在開喉射水降溫。消防員、救護車亦在場戒備。</p><figure><img alt=\"濃煙直冒上半空。（Threads/tommytigerisflying截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186677336456564736802473.jpeg/hoNp4w19QPiz5PGhnNN2tO9Cb4MCbyyUt7anzbe2p80\"/><figcaption>濃煙直冒上半空。（Threads/tommytigerisflying截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員接報到場開喉灌救。（羅敏妍攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186691051193110528158264.jpeg/93DMeoHopuhX_XAQJM2JStxLBR2n1_JON9h3oBLYd6A\"/><figcaption>消防員接報到場開喉灌救。（羅敏妍攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員到場開喉灌救。（羅敏妍攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186691192042033152302915.jpeg/JvOEXbMxN1waJisqJFR79KALhsfI44wgVqWBI1algSM\"/><figcaption>消防員到場開喉灌救。（羅敏妍攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防車及救護車到場。（羅敏妍攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186691296736055296503184.jpeg/EeFhlIIhDFSJG3IBaP163XdbxJERu37Orgqr54sKq-c\"/><figcaption>消防車及救護車到場。（羅敏妍攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防及警方接報到場。（羅敏妍攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186691587875278848350271.jpeg/0XaogmPuD7ii4obeu8OGmco0qS43K1B9ABo19CUaNfQ\"/><figcaption>消防及警方接報到場。（羅敏妍攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員開喉灌救。（羅敏妍攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186691591012749312852930.jpeg/bXTAK-Cxw4_70PmqueswxtYyjrYa4R8OE_gTdTb4E3U\"/><figcaption>消防員開喉灌救。（羅敏妍攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防及警方接報到場。（羅敏妍攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186691593479131136127863.jpeg/ka1MEtMR1ao1jSYAmvk0GTS806E7R6a8fyblGFom5Rg\"/><figcaption>消防及警方接報到場。（羅敏妍攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員開喉灌救。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186691596394303488397201.jpeg/tGg_cxMd0CfJl2fbA76JMmsd9SBM06TSWJYr832WK_M\"/><figcaption>消防員開喉灌救。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-13T07:00:55.427955+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":304,"images":8,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T06:01:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T08:37:58.059961+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:57:47.040589+00:00","content_hash":"636c84ee3e9409b8b4a6841c86a5bd6e8a0c19abbbb0d6ddb47b6f302c5967e7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}